    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sup-poenĭtet</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subp-</span></b> ), ēre,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. n.
				impers.</i>,
			<i>to be somewhat sorry</i>, <i>to repent
				a little</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nam et illum furoris et hunc nostrum copiarum
					suppoenitet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 7, 14, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
